  "description": "Direct mode of MSI Mystic Light motherboard RGB controllers (vendor id 0x1462), adapted from OpenRGB's MSIMotherboardController: the 185-byte boards (per-LED colour streams with the JRAINBOW/JCORSAIR ARGB headers as channels, or one colour per zone on zone-based boards), the 162-byte boards (static colours) and the 112-byte boards (one colour per zone). The configuration read at start is written back on exit and the save-to-flash byte is never set. The MAG B550 TOMAHAWK (0x7C91) keeps its own plugin (msi-mystic-light-7c91); boards behind vendor id 0x0DB0 are in msi-mystic-light-common. Protocol notes: docs/hardware/msi-mystic-light.md.",
